{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073","id":2472067869,"node_id":"I_kwDOB8a8wc6TWMMd","number":3073,"title":"Shell auto-completion for `--theme` list the default theme incorrectly","user":{"login":"tautropfli","id":4602612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDI2MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4602612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli","html_url":"https://github.com/tautropfli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tautropfli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":909256493,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MDkyNTY0OTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2024-08-18T17:20:09Z","updated_at":"2024-10-06T19:27:20Z","closed_at":"2024-10-06T19:27:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"*(not at all severe)*\r\n\r\nWhen using auto-complete to complete the default theme in any shell with supported completions (I've tested fish, zsh and bash) the default theme is completed as `Monokai Extended (default)` instead of `Monokai Extended`.\r\n\r\nThis is because the completion scripts use `bat --list-themes | cat` to get the list of themes.\r\n#2937 changed the basic output to include the `(default)` suffix which breaks the completions.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**What steps will reproduce the bug?**\r\n\r\n1. Start bash, fish or zsh with bat's completions installed. See #3072 \r\n3. Type `bat --theme Monokai\\ Extended` and trigger auto-complete (press tab)\r\n\r\n**What happens?**\r\n\r\nThe suggestions include `Monokai Extended (default)` (not a valid theme name)\r\n\r\n**What did you expect to happen instead?**\r\n\r\nThe suggestions should include `Monokai Extended` instead.\r\n\r\n**How did you install `bat`?**\r\n\r\nFrom source: https://github.com/sharkdp/bat/commit/b662fec214daaa77a67f08d8fbd2e81915d6e0bc\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"keith-hall","id":11882719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODgyNzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11882719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall","html_url":"https://github.com/keith-hall","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keith-hall/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sharkdp/bat/issues/3073/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}